p+geom_smooth(aes(min=lcl,max=ucl),data=grid,stat="identity") ##I replaced
the ymin with min and y with max and now I get the

#correct response curve at the right value.

Now I just need to adjust the predicted response 95% confidence band to
include the lcl and ucl values.

I am using R 2.8.1

Any ideas,
Rob

